("FigS2_fraction_data.png", "Fraction observations.", "(A) Locations of the 1005 harmonized MAOC/POC records by fractionation method (particle size, n = 874; density, n = 122; combined, n = 9), from the synthesis of Georgiou et al. (including ISRAD and LUCAS subsets). (B) Distribution of observed f_MAOC by method (box, interquartile range; line, median; whiskers, 1.5 × interquartile range)."),
("FigS3_SHAP_top_features.png", "Most important predictors.", "Top eight covariates by share of mean |SHAP| (%) for (A) pH, (B) SIC presence, (C) SIC amount, (D) mineral SOC, and (E) f_MAOC (topsoil models; 30,000 random land cells). logAI, ln(1 + P/PET); bio1 to bio19, WorldClim bioclimatic variables; pH_pred, predicted pH; depth_mid, sample depth midpoint."),
